": "191333588", "author": {"steamid": "76561197996286978", "personaname": "Garfield面具", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/jamesrobby/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 27, "playtime_forever": 2047, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2021, "last_played": 1743115695, "avatar": "8a6638e6117fc31bd5a32f08461a3e55a3eb23a5"}, "language": "english", "review": "This game completely surprised me with how much fun it really gets. When I launched it the first couple times I was confused about what it exactly wants from me, or what the appeal is, but then soon I had my first build that \"clicked\"... and damn is it fun haha!! Things can escalate real hard in this game and I love that.", "timestamp_created": 1743113159, "timestamp_updated": 1743113159, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.53271031379699707", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "191097298", "author": {"steamid": "76561199049684775", "personaname": "Demsoni", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199049684775/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 38, "playtime_forever": 729, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 237, "last_played": 1776190119, "avatar": "aa774ae80a809f6dbb35028f92ca8c30d246709a"}, "language": "english", "review": "Highly addictive", "timestamp_created": 1742845303, "timestamp_updated": 1742845303, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "190907392", "author": {"steamid": "76561199087865217", "personaname": "GazMazk2112", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199087865217/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 5, "playtime_forever": 1607, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 936, "deck_playtime_at_review": 844, "last_played": 1789428082, "avatar": "3f47c3634c822270cbccf23f4cb4fcf2272e23d1"}, "language": "english", "review": "its a rougelike metroidvania what else do i have to say\r\n", "timestamp_created": 1742662033, "timestamp_updated": 1742662033, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": true, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "190799047", "author": {"steamid": "76561199474441485", "personaname": "Ruby", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199474441485/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 1864, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1858, "last_played": 1745055816, "avatar": "f24c6b47268cd2cec537ce639933195d8cfcc068"}, "language": "english", "review": "my first time writing review, anyway\nThere is something unique about Risk of Rain as rogue-like. Unlike other rogue-like where you are pity against whatever the game throws at you, here you actually can decide how you want to play. you can just rush to the portal and win the game or looping back to enjoy killing everything over and over again. Artifacts as run modifiers is also interesting.\n      but it also has its flaw such as game feels unfair with overwhelming numbers of enemies or too overpowered enemies and bosses as well as underwhelming survivors. some achievement that feels annoying and sisyphean to complete.\nOther than that I consider it a very decent rogue-like with very fun and interesting gameplay and the fact that this is from 2013. it really pave the way for its successors.\nOverall 7/10.\nDo I recommend playing it ? yeah, but go play this game's remake instead: Risk of Rain Return as it is better in every way. it's up to you to decide.", "timestamp_created": 1742562435, "timestamp_updated": 1742562435, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "190107571", "author": {"steamid": "76561198377313767", "personaname": "⎛⎝JC̭Ṱh̭ḙC̭a̭t⎠⎞", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/stupidumbass/", "num_games_owned": 209, "num_reviews": 56, "playtime_forever": 4760, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 4760, "last_played": 1703967201, "avatar": "35dd87c035a55f12cc5efb7a44fd9b9fb570e9b1"}, "language": "english", "review": "Amazing game, very addicting, great soundtrack, great pixel art, you can cook enemies, 11/10", "timestamp_created": 1741890491, "timestamp_updated": 1741890491, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 5, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.580915570259094238", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "189990132", "author": {"steamid": "76561198160700469", "personaname": "Nonemu", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Nonemu/", "num_games_owned": 1289, "num_reviews": 1828, "playtime_forever": 49, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 49, "last_played": 1642847363, "avatar": "5ccbb64b8d0e88b1f8b015778c790027e545487a"}, "language": "english", "review": "prefer the part 2 a lot more\ndidn't had f